SUMMARY:ʻOhina Labs 2026: Community Celebration and Greenlight Award Ann
 ouncement
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Hawai‘i and Pacific filmmaking with ‘Ohina Labs
  and Capitol Modern at an evening gathering honoring the 2026 ‘Ohina L
 abs filmmaker cohort and the local creative community. Connect with arti
 sts\, storytellers\, filmmakers\, and supporters while celebrating the n
 ext generation of independent filmmaking.\n\nThe evening will feature th
 e announcement of the 2026 ‘Ohina Greenlight Award winner\, recognizin
 g one filmmaker and their project with additional mentorship\, funding\,
  and production support to bring their screenplay to life as a completed
  film.\n\nGuests can also enjoy a rotating presentation of short films c
 reated by previous ‘Ohina Labs cohorts in Capitol Modern’s intimate 
 onsite theatre.\n  https://www.capitolmodern.org/events/ohina-labs-2026-
 community-celebration-and-greenlight-award-announcement  Sources: Capito
 l Modern https://www.capitolmodern.org/events/ohina-labs-2026-community-
 celebration-and-greenlight-award-announcement
LOCATION:Capitol Modern: the Hawaiʻi State Art Museum
URL:https://www.capitolmodern.org/events/ohina-labs-2026-community-celebr
 ation-and-greenlight-award-announcement
CATEGORIES:Capitol Modern
END:VEVENT
